#: ../../source/docs/common-basic-operation.rst:5
#: 6e1a67faa9f54adc91d156f3a7edd651
msgid "Simple Overview of ArduPilot Operation"
msgstr "ArduPilot 操作简介"

#: ../../source/docs/common-basic-operation.rst:9
#: 75adf4db95a6406995c92871633b9925
msgid ""
"This is a very basic overview of the functions of ArduPilot firmware running"
" on an autopilot. Shown below is a simple block diagram of the basic "
"functional operation. This will give you a better understanding of ArduPilot"
" basic functions as you configure your system."
msgstr ""
"本文是运行在飞控上的 ArduPilot 固件功能的基本概述，下图为基本功能操作的简单方框图。这将帮助您在配置系统时更好地理解 ArduPilot "
"的基本功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-basic-operation.rst:15
#: ab522ea215a84c6f87eb347af17a0aa0
msgid "Basic Goal"
msgstr "基本目标"

#: ../../source/docs/common-basic-operation.rst:17
#: 5557836578bf4444a50a71247013108f
msgid ""
"The basic goal of the software is to provide control of the vehicle, either "
"autonomously, or via pilot input through radio control transmitter or ground"
" control station, or via companion computer on board the vehicle, any of "
"which are optional, including only loading a fully autonomous mission on the"
" vehicle for execution."
msgstr ""
"软件的基本目标是提供对飞机的控制，可以是自主控制，也可以通过飞手借助遥控器或地面控制站进行输入，或通过飞机上的伴侣计算机进行控制，以上均为可选项，包括仅在飞机上加载完全自主的任务并执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-basic-operation.rst:20
#: 94c2ec309e644ce192213859183edb1c
msgid "Inputs"
msgstr "输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-basic-operation.rst:22
#: 6ac35e20f5bd44039f5cf2794be80297
msgid ""
"Control inputs are input either by radio control receiver, or via MAVLink "
"communication from telemetry or companion computers. The radio control "
"receiver provides Roll/Pitch/Yaw inputs for desired attitude control, "
"vehicle power (throttle), as well as control of operational modes and "
"auxiliary functions. The radio control inputs for Roll/Pitch/Yaw/Throttle "
"can be assigned to any radio control channel via the ``RCMAP_x`` functions. "
"Auxiliary functions are assigned using the ``RCx_FUNCTION`` parameters."
msgstr ""
"控制输入由遥控接收机输入，或通过数传或伴侣计算机的 MAVLink "
"通信输入。遥控接收机提供横滚/俯仰/偏航姿态控制输入、飞机动力（油门）以及操作模式和辅助功能控制。横滚/俯仰/偏航/油门的遥控输入可通过 "
"``RCMAP_x`` 功能分配到任意遥控通道。辅助功能使用 ``RCx_FUNCTION`` 参数分配。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-basic-operation.rst:25
#: c4a1e6ebf0c34bc1b0d41b1fc1041ab1
msgid "Outputs"
msgstr "输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-basic-operation.rst:26
#: 04587fc41a7e43b29b92aad53dfdf4ec
msgid ""
"Outputs are provided to activate servos, motors, relays, etc. to control the"
" vehicle. Any autopilot output can be assigned the desired vehicle control "
"output function via the ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` parameters. Note that outputs do"
" NOT necessarily correspond to any RC input, unless their function is set to"
" RCPassThru."
msgstr ""
"输出用于激活舵机、电机、继电器等以控制飞机。任何飞控输出均可通过 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` "
"参数分配所需的飞机控制输出功能。注意，输出不一定对应任何 RC 输入，除非其功能设置为 RCPassThru。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-basic-operation.rst:29
#: 2acac1573c9740cfb408997d19065ec6
msgid "Sensors"
msgstr "传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-basic-operation.rst:31
#: e4ae53b57ed14eb995f9dda6490e8efa
msgid ""
"Attitude, position, power system monitoring, and vehicle speed are provided "
"by sensor inputs to the autopilot. All ArduPilot compatible autopilots have "
"at least one or more accelerometers, baros, and gyros integrated onboard. "
"Typically a GPS, and often, a Compass sensor is required. Usually these are "
"provided externally. Some controllers have multiple instances of sensors for"
" redundancy, a key feature of the ArduPilot software. Many sensors require a"
" one-time calibration during the Mandatory Hardware setup step."
msgstr ""
"姿态、位置、电源系统监测和飞机速度由传感器输入提供给飞控。所有 ArduPilot 兼容飞控均至少集成一个加速度计、气压计和陀螺仪。通常需要 "
"GPS，且通常需要罗盘传感器。这些传感器通常从外部提供。部分飞控具有多个传感器实例以提供冗余，这是 ArduPilot "
"软件的核心特性。许多传感器在必要硬件配置步骤中需要一次性校准。"
